  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 103.06 Computerized Lists Distribution.\n\nA computerized list of licensees who have agreed to share their name, email and physical address shall be furnished upon request. The fee shall be $100.00.\n\nSource. #11144, eff 7-28-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nur100-800.html"
